{
  "id": 79508,
  "title": "[Trả hàng/ Hoàn tiền] Cách đóng gói đơn hàng hoàn trả",
  "content": "<div class=\"use-tiny-editor\"><strong style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Đóng gói đơn hàng hoàn trả theo hướng dẫn của Shopee để đảm bảo an toàn cho sản phẩm bên trong tránh mất mát hoặc hư hỏng, giúp quá trình hoàn trả nhanh chóng, không bị từ chối.</span></strong></div><div style=\"margin-left: 1em;\"><p style=\"background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Các bước đóng gói hàng hoàn trả:</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Để đảm bảo tình trạng hàng hoàn trả nguyên vẹn hoặc không hư hỏng nặng hơn, Shopee khuyến khích bạn chuẩn bị vật liệu đóng gói và tham khảo hướng dẫn đóng gói theo tiêu chuẩn của Shopee</span><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://banhang.shopee.vn/edu/article/239/Huong-dan-dong-goi-hang-chuan-Shopee\"><span style=\"color: #1155cc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: underline;\"> tại đây.</span></a></p><p style=\"background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><ol style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\"><li style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><p style=\"background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Chuẩn bị:</span></p></li></ol><ul style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\"><li style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><p style=\"background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Vật liệu đóng gói (hộp carton/bao bì, băng dính, vật liệu chèn như giấy, xốp, bong bóng khí…)</span></p></li><li style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><p style=\"background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Phiếu gửi hàng (in từ hệ thống hoặc viết tay).</span></p></li></ul><div>&nbsp;</div><ol style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\" start=\"2\"><li style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Đóng hàng:</span></p></li></ol><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 3em;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 3em;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Bạn cần đóng gói và quay video quá trình đóng gói sản phẩm hoàn trả, bao gồm hộp của nhà sản xuất, giấy tờ, phụ kiện, quà tặng đi kèm… (nếu có) và đóng gói với đầy đủ vật liệu, quy cách đóng gói theo&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">tiêu chuẩn của Shopee</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">hoặc</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">như khi nhận hàng </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">(quy cách đóng gói của Người bán).</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 3em;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 3em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 77, 45);\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none;\">⚠️ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Lưu ý:</span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Bạn cần sử dụng hộp vận chuyển bên ngoài để đảm bảo sản phẩm và hộp của nhà sản xuất không bị hư hại.</span></li><li>Luôn ghi hình lại quá trình đóng gói hàng hoàn, nhằm đảm bảo quyền lợi khi Người bán có phát sinh khiếu nại hàng hoàn trả.</li><li>Với&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">hàng</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">dễ vỡ</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">hàng</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">chứa chất lỏng</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">, bạn cần:</span><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><li>Đóng chặt nắp chai.</li><li>Cho vào trong thùng vừa với kích cỡ sản phẩm.</li><li>Sử dụng các vật liệu đệm như bong bóng, màng co, xốp,... giúp giảm va đập.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><strong style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></strong></span></strong></strong><div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; max-width: 100%; width: 98.6658%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 46.0275%;\" width=\"226\"><col style=\"width: 27.7171%;\" width=\"189\"><col style=\"width: 26.2291%;\" width=\"191\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: solid #000000 1pt; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Hộp vận chuyển</span></p></td><td style=\"border: solid #000000 1pt; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;\" colspan=\"2\"><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Hộp nhà sản xuất</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: solid #000000 1pt; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><strong>·</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Là loại hộp trơn, thường làm bằng carton cứng.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><strong>·</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Không in logo, hình ảnh hay thông tin sản phẩm.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border: solid #000000 1pt; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;\" colspan=\"2\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><strong>·</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Là hộp thiết kế bởi nhà sản xuất, thường có logo, hình ảnh minh họa, thông tin về sản phẩm (tên, thông số kỹ thuật, hướng dẫn sử dụng...).</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><strong>·</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Kích thước vừa khít với sản phẩm.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: solid #000000 1pt; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border: none;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; margin-top: -14.9819px;\" src=\"https://fileproxy.scsusercontent.com/api/v5/service/download/lifecycle_2025/helpcenter-fe/16caf4f9fec540ceacbd706a104006aa.jpg\" width=\"169\" height=\"169.0018044731555\"></span></span></p></td><td style=\"border: solid #000000 1pt; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border: none;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; margin-top: 0px;\" src=\"https://fileproxy.scsusercontent.com/api/v5/service/download/lifecycle_2025/helpcenter-fe/1170516318df4bec984249c918c5913e.png\" width=\"168\" height=\"110\"></span></span></p></td><td style=\"border: solid #000000 1pt; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border: none;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; margin-top: 0px;\" src=\"https://fileproxy.scsusercontent.com/api/v5/service/download/lifecycle_2025/helpcenter-fe/413cb0bf11a446fe85a76f595a18aabf.png\" width=\"217.17391304347828\" height=\"109\"></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div>&nbsp;</div><ol style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\" start=\"3\"><li style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ee4d2d; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Viết mã vận đơn lên hộp hàng:</span></p></li></ol><strong style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></strong></span></strong></strong><ul style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\"><li style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Mã vận đơn: Vào ứng dụng Shopee &gt; Mục </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Tôi</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"> &gt; </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Trả hàng/ hoàn tiền</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"> &gt; Tại đơn đang cần trả hàng, bấm </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Thông tin lấy hàng</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"> hoặc </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Trả hàng tại bưu cục.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Khi đóng gói hàng hoàn trả, bạn vui lòng dán hoặc viết thông tin trả hàng tại hộp đóng gói vận chuyển.</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 2em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 77, 45);\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none;\">⚠️&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Lưu ý: </span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Không dán, viết lên hộp của nhà sản xuất. </span></li><li><strong>Với hình thức Đơn vị vận chuyển đến lấy hàng và Trả hàng tại bưu cục:</strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><strong> </strong>Bạn chỉ cần<em> </em></span><em><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">in, dán phiếu gửi hàng hoặc</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"